country-style bread", "group": null, "quantity": 8.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "1-inch-square bread cubes", "preparation": "from good country-style bread", "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "8 ounces goat cheese", "group": null, "quantity": 8.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "oz", "item": "goat cheese", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 10, "raw": "2 tablespoons coarsely chopped Italian parsley", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "coarsely chopped italian parsley", "preparation": null, "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Preheat the oven to 200 degrees. Using a pastry brush and 1 tablespoon of olive oil, lightly coat the skin side of each tomato half. Place skin side down on 2 baking sheets. Sprinkle with 1 teaspoon of salt and pepper. Bake until the tomatoes shrink to about one-quarter of their original size, about 4 to 6 hours; they should be soft and juicy. Cool. Sprinkle with the thyme."}, {"position": 2, "text": "Cook the lima beans as directed, until quite soft. Drain and place in a food processor with 3 tablespoons of olive oil, the cream, 1 ½ teaspoons of salt and pepper. Process until smooth."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees. Place the bread cubes in the bottom of a 12-by-3 ½-inch round clay casserole dish. Toss with 3 tablespoons of olive oil. Bake until the bread is toasted, tossing twice, about 20 minutes."}, {"position": 4, "text": "Top the bread with the dried tomatoes. Crumble the goat cheese over the tomatoes. Spread the bean puree over the goat cheese. (The tian can be prepared a few hours ahead up to this point; bring to room temperature before baking.) Cover with aluminum foil and bake until heated through, about 45 minutes. Serve immediately."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 679.5, "protein_g": 26.2, "carbohydrates_g": 69.1, "fat_g": 35.3, "saturated_fat_g": 13.0, "trans_fat_g": 0.3, "cholesterol_mg": 39.8, "sodium_mg": 1245.7, "fiber_g": 13.7, "sugar_g": 14.7, "unsaturated_fat_g": 19.6, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": [], "diet": ["vegetarian"], "course": ["main course", "side dish"], "meal": ["dinner"], "occasion": [], "other": ["bake", "boil", "casseroles", "goat cheese", "heavy cream", "olive oil", "plum tomato", "summer"]}, "images": [], "rating": {"average": 3.0, "count": 5}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "1995-09-03", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T00:53:29.524407+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
